5. Evidence required from the AWS S3 team
The notebook provides application-level evidence. Ask the S3 team to correlate it with AWS logs and configuration.
Evidence	Who provides it
Notebook run ID, timestamp, HTTP result	Databricks team
Sanitized hostname and test object key	Databricks team
S3 CloudTrail data event for GET/PUT	S3 team
vpcEndpointId, where recorded	S3 team
Interface endpoint ID, service and status	Network/S3 team
VPC Flow Logs for endpoint ENIs, if enabled	Network team
S3 FIPS service/hostname and endpoint configuration	S3 team

For a complete sign-off, correlate the request timestamp and S3 object key with CloudTrail, and verify the intended VPC endpoint ID and private route. For FIPS, confirm the request targeted the FIPS endpoint and that the intended FIPS private endpoint was used.
